sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant LS as LeadService
    participant CIS as ClientIntegrationService
    participant CS as ClientService

    FE->>LS: POST /api/leads
    LS->>CIS: findOrCreateClient(cnpj, name, phone)
    CIS->>CS: HTTP POST /api/clients/find-or-create
    Note over CIS,CS: BLOQUEANTE — espera resposta
    CS-->>CIS: ClientResponse
    CIS-->>LS: Optional.of(dto)
    LS->>LS: lead.setClientId(dto.id())
    LS-->>FE: 201 Created (com clientId)
